[[0,463714,0,4,0,4,"2015-08-30T08:22:41","squataclops","",[],"","Man Drops Marijuana In X-Ray Bucket At Tulsa Courthouse Checkpoint","http://m.newson6.com/story.aspx?story=29908937&catId=112042","NewsOfTheStupid"],[1,2153842,0,1,0,1,"2015-08-30T10:32:46","Mosin91","[e]",[],"<p>Aww Oklahoma is so cute. Leave your knives, guns and weed at home? Here in Washington we have state mandated lockboxes for people's guns before they enter the courtroom. I've used them twice, once on jury duty, and once on an assignment for a class. Just get the key, stick my pistol in there, and go about my business. Not bad for a left wing state. Oh and we have legal weed too. Suck it OK.</p>"]]
